[2.3798, "o", "search . Often he would be surrounded by an eager circle, all waiting to be served; holding boat\r\n  research -spades, pike-heads, harpoons, and lances, and jealously watching his every sooty movemen\r\n  research t, as he toiled. Nevertheless, this old man's was a patient hammer wielded by a patient a\r\n  research rm. No murmur, no impatience, no petulance did come from him. Silent, slow, and solemn; b\r\n  research owing over still further his chronically broken back, he toiled away, as if toil were lif\r\n  research e itself, and the heavy beating of his hammer the heavy beating of his heart. And so it w\r\n  research as.\u2014Most miserable! A peculiar walk in this old man, a certain slight but painful appeari\r\n  research ng yawing in his gait, had at an early period of the voyage excited the curiosity of the \r\n  research mariners. And to the importunity of their persisted questionings he had finally given in;\r\n  research  and so it came to pass that every one now knew the shameful story of his wretched fate. \r\n  rese"]
[2.3799, "o", "arch Belated, and not innocently, one bitter winter's midnight, on the road running between tw\r\n  research o country towns, the blacksmith half-stupidly felt the deadly numbness stealing over him,\r\n  research  and sought refuge in a leaning, dilapidated barn. The issue was, the loss of the extremi\r\n  research ties of both feet. Out of this revelation, part by part, at last came out the four acts o\r\n  research f the gladness, and the one long, and as yet uncatastrophied fifth act of the grief of hi\r\n  research s life's drama. He was an old man, who, at the age of nearly sixty, had po\",\"kind\":\"docum\r\n  research ent\",\"id\":\"edd43382-00db-4180-8b8a-adf65744f513:p2\",\"snapshotId\":\"edd43382-00db-4180-8b8a\r\n  research -adf65744f513\",\"url\":\"https://httpbin.org/html\"}]}\r\n"]
